NAME
    gcloud sql ssl entraid-certs - provide commands for managing Entra ID
        certificates of Cloud SQL instances

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud sql ssl entraid-certs COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Provide commands for managing Entra ID certificates of Cloud SQL instances,
    including creating, listing, rotating in, and rolling back certificates.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        Create an Entra ID certificate for a Cloud SQL instance.

     list
        List all Entra ID certificates for a Cloud SQL instance.

     rollback
        Roll back to the previous Entra ID certificate for a Cloud SQL
        instance.

     rotate
        Rotate in the upcoming Entra ID certificate for a Cloud SQL instance.

NOTES
    These variants are also available:

        $ gcloud alpha sql ssl entraid-certs

        $ gcloud beta sql ssl entraid-certs

